Cc: Sergei Ianovich <ynvich@gmail.com>, Daniel Mack <zonque@gmail.com>, Arnd Bergmann <arnd@arndb.de>, Rob Herring <rob.herring@calxeda.com>, Pawel Moll <pawel.moll@arm.com>, Mark Rutland <mark.rutland@arm.com>, Stephen Warren <swarren@wwwdotorg.org>, Ian Campbell <ijc+devicetree@hellion.org.uk>, Russell King <linux@arm.linux.org.uk>, "open list:OPEN FIRMWARE AND..." <devicetree@vger.kernel.org>
